rabbit(V) & spotted(V) => cute(V). @ "All rabbits that can be spotted near the campus are cute"
turtle(some_turtle_1). @ "Some turtles can be spotted near the campus"
spotted(some_turtle_1). @ "Some turtles can be spotted near the campus"
spotted(V) => rabbit(V) | squirrel(V). @ "The only animals that can be spotted near the campus are rabbits and squirrels"
skittish(V) => not calm(V). @ "If something is skittish, then it is not calm"
squirrel(V) & spotted(V) => skittish(V). @ "All the squirrels that can be spotted near the campus are skittish"
spotted(rockie). @ "Rockie can be spotted near the campus"
calm(rockie). @ "it is calm"
? cute(rockie) | skittish(rockie).
